[Triggers]
Block	1	CaveHornet
Block	1	Spider
Block	1	Rat
Block	1	Roach
Block	1	LavaSpawn
Block	1	LizardMan
Block	1	DarkElf
Block	1	Orc
Block	1	PitDemon
Block	1	Troll
Region	Grove	8	22	21	31
Region	Landing	29	18	38	28
Region	Village	38	25	51	35
Region	Keep	41	4	53	12
[Trigger]
Name	ferns
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	My lord, Brackenford is rich in gold and thin in soldiers. You have gold to spend, so spend it on rooms.
Action	objective	1	Destroy Warden Elsa Brack and take her keep.
Action	objective	1	Lay out a dormitory for your creatures.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	bedsReady
Mode	once
Cond	room	1	Dormitory	1
Action	message	1	Beds at last. The creatures from the old portal will want food as well.
Action	objective	1	Build a hatchery.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	larderReady
Mode	once
Cond	room	1	Hatchery	1
Action	message	1	The larder is stocked. Now take the fern grove east of here and make it yours.
Action	gold	1	400
Action	objective	1	Claim the fern grove.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	groveClaimed
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Grove	22
Action	message	1	Two goblins have heard about your grove and want a share. Let them stay.
Action	spawn	1	12	28	-1	Goblin:2	Goblin:2
Action	reveal	1	Landing
Action	objective	1	Cross the ford and clear the landing yard.
Action	generate	1	Goblin:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	landingSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Landing
Action	message	1	The ford folk have seen you. Expect them to come down the bank.
Action	spawn	3	36	23	1	Adventurer:1	Adventurer:1
Action	setflag	fordRaised	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	villageOpen
Mode	once
Cond	flag	fordRaised	1
Cond	kills	1	>=	4
Action	message	1	The landing is clear. The village and the keep lie behind it.
Action	reveal	1	Village
Action	reveal	1	Keep
Action	objective	1	Fight your way to the keep and slay the warden.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstFolk
Mode	once
Cond	time	480
Action	message	1	A few villagers have taken up spades and swords. They are coming over the ford.
Action	spawn	3	37	24	1	Adventurer:1	Adventurer:1	Monk:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	secondFolk
Mode	once
Cond	time	960
Action	message	1	The warden has called in the last of her riders.
Action	spawn	3	38	12	1	Adventurer:2	Adventurer:1	Knight:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wardenGone
Mode	once
Cond	time	5
Cond	creatures	2	<=	0
Action	message	1	Warden Brack is dead. The ford folk are laying down their tools.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
